They may be nobles, but even high-ranking nobles are powerless against the world government and celestial dragons.

276
00:18:10,324 --> 00:18:12,284
How's Luffy doing?

277
00:18:12,364 --> 00:18:13,004
Is he any better?

278
00:18:13,444 --> 00:18:15,464
Well, he hasn't been eating much.

279
00:18:15,784 --> 00:18:17,964
But he still eats twice as much as we do.

280
00:18:18,244 --> 00:18:20,324
Sabo's death must have really gotten to him.

281
00:18:20,324 --> 00:18:48,344
Ace, Luffy, listen.

282
00:18:48,344 --> 00:18:51,564
The three of us, we're going to leave this country.

283
00:18:52,284 --> 00:18:55,084
We're going to sail the seas and see the whole world.

284
00:18:57,084 --> 00:18:59,824
From now on, we're honest-to-goodness brothers.

285
00:19:00,244 --> 00:19:01,104
Cheers to that.

286
00:19:01,104 --> 00:19:03,164
Brothers!

287
00:19:03,164 --> 00:19:03,444
Brothers!

288
00:19:23,444 --> 00:19:25,764
How long are you going to lay there like a moron?

289
00:19:25,764 --> 00:19:31,244
By the way, the treasure we were keeping in the forest is gone.

290
00:19:31,804 --> 00:19:33,044
Someone must have gotten to it.

291
00:19:34,364 --> 00:19:36,524
Survivors from Blue Jam's crew might have taken it.

292
00:19:36,844 --> 00:19:37,784
Or maybe the military.

293
00:19:38,404 --> 00:19:40,884
Either way, there's nothing we can do at this point.

294
00:19:42,224 --> 00:19:42,484
Meh.

295
00:19:42,704 --> 00:19:43,924
I don't care about the treasure.

296
00:19:44,204 --> 00:19:44,744
Not anymore.

297
00:19:44,744 --> 00:19:49,044
I mean, those were pirate savings I was sharing with Sabo.

298
00:19:49,244 --> 00:19:50,744
And you too later on, I guess.

299
00:19:51,404 --> 00:19:54,164
But in the end, he didn't need money to set sail.

300
00:19:54,644 --> 00:19:56,704
So why should I get bent out of shape about it?

301
00:19:57,124 --> 00:20:01,604
After all, what's the point in having treasure if you can't even protect it?

302
00:20:01,924 --> 00:20:02,084
I...

303
00:20:02,084 --> 00:20:04,664
Hey, Ace...

304
00:20:04,664 --> 00:20:06,184
I...

305
00:20:06,184 --> 00:20:07,084
I...

306
00:20:07,084 --> 00:20:09,904
I want to get stronger.

307
00:20:10,544 --> 00:20:13,824
Stronger...

308
00:20:13,824 --> 00:20:15,504
And stronger and stronger...

309
00:20:15,504 --> 00:20:17,624
And stronger and stronger.

310
00:20:17,624 --> 00:20:19,904
And stronger and stronger.

311
00:20:20,564 --> 00:20:22,084
Stronger and stronger.

312
00:20:22,364 --> 00:20:25,104
Stronger and stronger and stronger and stronger.

313
00:20:25,704 --> 00:20:26,024
And stronger and stronger.

314
00:20:26,404 --> 00:20:29,004
I want to be the strongest in the world.

315
00:20:29,004 --> 00:20:32,004
And then, I'll protect everyone.

316
00:20:32,004 --> 00:20:35,004
I won't lose anyone I care about.

317
00:20:35,004 --> 00:20:38,004
You gotta make me a promise.

318
00:20:38,004 --> 00:20:40,004
I'm begging you.

319
00:20:40,004 --> 00:20:43,004
Please don't die, Gaze!

320
00:20:43,004 --> 00:20:45,004
Cut it out.

321
00:20:45,004 --> 00:20:48,004
You ought to be worried about dying before I do.

322
00:20:48,004 --> 00:20:50,004
What, did you forget you're a lot weaker than me?

323
00:20:50,004 --> 00:20:53,004
Listen, and you listen up good.

324
00:20:53,004 --> 00:20:56,004
I'm never going to die.

325
00:20:59,004 --> 00:21:04,004
You know, Sabo told me to take care of you.

326
00:21:04,004 --> 00:21:08,004
So I promise, I'm not gonna die, okay? Not ever.

327
00:21:08,004 --> 00:21:13,004
At least not as long as I've got a wussy little brother who needs me to protect him.

328
00:21:13,004 --> 00:21:15,004
Yeah, okay.

329
00:21:15,004 --> 00:21:17,004
Smarts aren't exactly my strong point.

330
00:21:17,004 --> 00:21:21,004
So, I still don't really understand why Sabo was killed.

331
00:21:21,004 --> 00:21:25,004
But whoever did it, they must be opposed to freedom.

332
00:21:25,004 --> 00:21:28,004
Because they shot him down before he ever got a taste of it.

333
00:21:28,004 --> 00:21:34,004
But we shared that same cup of sake with him and we're still alive.

334
00:21:37,004 --> 00:21:40,004
Luffy, listen to me, okay?

335
00:21:40,004 --> 00:21:42,004
There's just one way to live.

336
00:21:42,004 --> 00:21:45,004
And that's without any regrets.

337
00:21:45,004 --> 00:22:02,004
Boys from families like mine?

338
00:22:02,004 --> 00:22:06,004
Once they turn 18, they're officially registered as nobles.

339
00:22:06,004 --> 00:22:08,004
That's why I'm leaving.

340
00:22:08,004 --> 00:22:10,004
I gotta be gone before I'm 17.

341
00:22:13,004 --> 00:22:17,004
Someday, we're gonna set sail just like Sabo.

342
00:22:17,004 --> 00:22:20,004
We're gonna live the way we wanna live.

343
00:22:20,004 --> 00:22:22,004
More free than anyone else.

344
00:22:22,004 --> 00:22:27,004
But you know what that means.

345
00:22:27,004 --> 00:22:29,004
We'll make plenty of enemies along the way.

346
00:22:29,004 --> 00:22:32,004
We're gonna have to fight Garp someday, I bet.

347
00:22:32,004 --> 00:22:34,004
We gotta be willing to risk everything.

348
00:22:34,004 --> 00:22:38,004
Let's go out to sea at 17, just like Sabo planned.

349
00:22:38,004 --> 00:22:41,004
Then, we'll be pirates.

350
00:22:41,004 --> 00:22:42,004
We're pirates.

351
00:23:11,004 --> 00:23:16,004
Luffy and Ace bury their sorrow and grow stronger day after day as they train to be pirates.

352
00:23:16,004 --> 00:23:21,004
As time marches on, they soon bid farewell to their childhood home and take to the sea at last.

353
00:23:21,004 --> 00:23:25,004
In hopes of achieving the dream that Sabo could not.

354
00:23:25,004 --> 00:23:33,004
On the next, One Piece, to live up to the promise, departures of their own, I'm gonna be king of the pirates!

